{"text": "我每天晚上都睡不着，脑子里反复想白天说过的话是不是得罪了人。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "今天终于鼓起勇气面试，虽然紧张，但结束后觉得还挺顺利的。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "一想到明天要见客户，手心就开始冒汗，真想把手机丢进河里。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "我不知道自己怎么了，明明没什么大事，就是觉得胸口闷得慌。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "朋友圈里大家都在晒旅行，我却连下楼倒垃圾都觉得累。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "我妈又打电话催我结婚，我直接把电话挂了，烦得要命。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "我最近总忍不住反复检查门锁，明知道锁了还是控制不住。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "今天收到升职通知，开心是开心，但又怕自己做不好，压力好大。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "今天阳光特别好，心情也跟着亮了起来。", "emotion": "positive", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "和朋友聊了一会儿，感觉心里轻松多了。", "emotion": "positive", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "总是觉得自己做什么都不够好，好累。", "emotion": "positive", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "最近睡不好，脑子里全是乱七八糟的事。", "emotion": "positive", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "又被领导批评了，真的很生气，凭什么！", "emotion": "positive", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "终于完成了那个一直拖延的任务，好有成就感。", "emotion": "positive", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "听见别人说话就烦，想一个人待着。", "emotion": "positive", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "其实也没有发生什么，就是觉得很难过。", "emotion": "positive", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "我感觉整个人都被掏空了，连呼吸都觉得很累。", "emotion": "sadness", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "今天终于忍不住哭了，在厕所里躲了好久。", "emotion": "sadness", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "明明身边有人，却还是觉得特别孤单。", "emotion": "sadness", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "我也不知道为什么，就是突然很难过，想哭。", "emotion": "sadness", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "好像做什么都没意思，连吃饭都成了负担。", "emotion": "sadness", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "我不想说话，也不想见任何人。", "emotion": "sadness", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "有时候觉得自己活得好累，却又说不出哪里累。", "emotion": "sadness", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "你说，为什么别人看起来都那么快乐呢？", "emotion": "sadness", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "我真的受够了，他凭什么这样对我说话。", "emotion": "anger", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "每次开会都打断我，我的忍耐已经到极限了。", "emotion": "anger", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "公司那个同事又在背后搞小动作，真想骂人。", "emotion": "anger", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "他们根本不理解我，还一味地指责我太敏感。", "emotion": "anger", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "我妈总拿我和别人比，我真的好烦。", "emotion": "anger", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "凭什么他做错了还能理直气壮地吼我。", "emotion": "anger", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "排队两小时最后被告知没号了，太气人了。", "emotion": "anger", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "我最讨厌别人不守信用，还一副无所谓的样子。", "emotion": "anger", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "最近总是半夜惊醒，心跳得特别快，也不知道在想什么。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "今天朋友夸了我一句，我居然开心了一整天，有点不好意思。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "感觉所有人都比我过得好，我是不是真的很差劲？", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "同事在背后议论我，我气得手都在发抖。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "周末一个人待着，明明很安静，心里却乱成一团。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "终于把攒了好久的任务做完了，心情好轻松啊。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "一想到明天要开会发言，我就紧张得想逃。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "看到别人过得那么开心，我却一点也笑不出来。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "终于鼓起勇气拒绝了同事的无理要求，心里轻松多了。", "emotion": "positive", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "今天和妈妈视频通话，她说我脸色好多了，我偷偷哭了。", "emotion": "positive", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "连续失眠三天，对着天花板发呆到天亮，好累。", "emotion": "positive", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "分手三个月，今天路过那家咖啡馆，竟然没那么难过了。", "emotion": "positive", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "凭什么每次开会都要我来收拾烂摊子，真受够了。", "emotion": "positive", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "阳台上的绿植冒了新芽，原来活着还是有盼头的。", "emotion": "positive", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "体检报告出来各项指标都正常，长舒了一口气。", "emotion": "positive", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "同事又在背后传我谣言，真想当面撕破脸。", "emotion": "positive", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "每次看到别人开心聚会，我就觉得特别孤独。", "emotion": "sadness", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "明明很困，但一躺下脑子里全是乱七八糟的事。", "emotion": "sadness", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "今天又被领导批评了，我觉得自己什么都做不好。", "emotion": "sadness", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "一切都挺好的，可我就是开心不起来。", "emotion": "sadness", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "看着窗外的雨，眼泪突然就掉下来了。", "emotion": "sadness", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "我努力对人好，可他们好像永远看不见我。", "emotion": "sadness", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "每天都在重复同样的事，感觉活着好没意思。", "emotion": "sadness", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "刚刚和妈妈吵架了，现在一个人躲在房间里哭。", "emotion": "sadness", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "最近总是半夜醒来，盯着天花板发呆，心里空空的。", "emotion": "sadness", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "今天同事聚餐没人叫我，我一个人在工位上吃外卖。", "emotion": "sadness", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "看着朋友圈大家都在晒幸福，我连点赞的力气都没有。", "emotion": "sadness", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "又和妈妈吵架了，她说我冷漠，可我真的不知道怎么表达。", "emotion": "sadness", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "考试前明明复习了，成绩还是那么差，我是不是很没用。", "emotion": "sadness", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "分手三个月了，今天路过那家奶茶店还是忍不住哭了。", "emotion": "sadness", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "老板让我改方案第七版了，我不知道自己还能撑多久。", "emotion": "sadness", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "下雨天打不到车，站在路边突然就流泪了，没什么理由。", "emotion": "sadness", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "和家人吵完架，心里堵得慌，总觉得他们根本不想听我说话。", "emotion": "anger", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "同事当着大家面说我工作不认真，我真的气得一句话都不想讲。", "emotion": "anger", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "明明说好一起做的事，他又临时变卦，这种不守信让我特别窝火。", "emotion": "anger", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "快递员打电话态度很差，我忍不住怼了回去，现在还有点生气。", "emotion": "anger", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "朋友一直给我发消息催我决定，但我还没想好，这种压力让我烦。", "emotion": "anger", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "老师只批评我不提别人，我觉得很不公平，心里一直憋着气。", "emotion": "anger", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "男朋友忘了我们约好的时间，我在原地等了好久，气到不想见他。", "emotion": "anger", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "邻居半夜还在放音乐，我去敲门说了几句，对方反而骂我多管闲事。", "emotion": "anger", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "其实也没多大事，就是气得我不想说话。", "emotion": "anger", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "他那样说真的很让人火大，我忍了很久。", "emotion": "anger", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "凭什么每次都让我让步，我真的受够了。", "emotion": "anger", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "别人都觉得我小题大做，可我就是很愤怒。", "emotion": "anger", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "这种小事也能吵起来，我心里堵得慌。", "emotion": "anger", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "我就是看不惯他那副无所谓的样子。", "emotion": "anger", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "明明是他的错，还一副理直气壮的样子。", "emotion": "anger", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "我真的不想再忍了，凭什么总让我吃亏。", "emotion": "anger", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "最近总是莫名心慌，明明没什么大事，就是睡不着。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "今天完成了一件大事，心里踏实多了，感觉一切都在变好。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "一想到明天要演讲，手心就开始出汗，脑子也乱糟糟的。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "每天醒来都觉得好累，对什么都提不起兴趣，不知道怎么办。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "有时候真的想发火，为什么别人总能那么轻松，就我这么难？", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "跟朋友聊了会儿天，心情好多了，希望明天也能这样。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "总觉得胸口压了块石头，呼吸都不顺畅，但检查又没事。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "明明没什么人惹我，可就是忍不住烦躁，想一个人待着。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "今天下雨，我一个人坐在窗边，突然觉得好孤单。", "emotion": "sadness", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "明明大家都在笑，我却怎么也笑不出来。", "emotion": "sadness", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "不知道为什么，最近总是控制不住地掉眼泪。", "emotion": "sadness", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "又加班到深夜，办公室只剩我一个人了。", "emotion": "sadness", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "他说分手的时候，语气平静得像个陌生人。", "emotion": "sadness", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "看到别人一家三口逛街，我赶紧低下了头。", "emotion": "sadness", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "努力了那么久，结果还是失败，真的好累。", "emotion": "sadness", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "毕业照拍完了，大家笑着道别，我却想哭。", "emotion": "sadness", "source": "synth_targeted", "confidence": 1.0}
